#. type: Title =
#: modules/ROOT/pages/user/external-interfaces/rest-control.adoc
#, no-wrap
msgid "OpenEMS: Control via REST/JSON"
msgstr "OpenEMS: Steuern über REST/JSON"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/ROOT/pages/user/external-interfaces/rest-control.adoc
msgid ""
"Via the REST interface, third-party systems such as a home automation system "
"(Home Assistant, ioBroker, Node-RED …) or your own scripts can **read values "
"from OpenEMS and control the system**. Simple HTTP calls are sufficient."
msgstr ""
"Über die REST-Schnittstelle können Fremdsysteme wie eine Hausautomation "
"(Home Assistant, ioBroker, Node-RED …) oder eigene Skripte **Werte aus "
"OpenEMS lesen und die Anlage steuern**. Es genügen einfache HTTP-Aufrufe."

#. type: #sec-setup
#: modules/ROOT/pages/user/external-interfaces/rest-control.adoc
msgid "There are two variants:"
msgstr "Es gibt zwei Varianten:"

#. type: Table
#: modules/ROOT/pages/user/external-interfaces/rest-control.adoc
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Function\n"
"| allows\n"
"\n"
"| Controller.Api.Rest.ReadOnly\n"
"| reading only\n"
"| Controller.Api.Rest.ReadWrite\n"
"| reading and controlling\n"
msgstr ""
"| Funktion\n"
"| erlaubt\n"
"\n"
"| Controller.Api.Rest.ReadOnly\n"
"| nur lesen\n"
"| Controller.Api.Rest.ReadWrite\n"
"| lesen und steuern\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/ROOT/pages/user/external-interfaces/rest-control.adoc
msgid "**Port:** 8084 by default."
msgstr "**Port:** standardmäßig 8084."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/ROOT/pages/user/external-interfaces/rest-control.adoc
msgid ""
"**Login:** with the password of an OpenEMS user. The user name is arbitrary; "
"`+x+` is common. What is allowed depends on the role of the user."
msgstr ""
"**Anmeldung:** mit dem Passwort eines OpenEMS-Benutzers. Der Benutzername "
"ist beliebig, üblich ist `+x+`. Was erlaubt ist, hängt von der Rolle des "
"Benutzers ab."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/ROOT/pages/user/external-interfaces/rest-control.adoc
msgid "**Api-Timeout:** 60 seconds by default (explanation below)."
msgstr "**Api-Timeout:** standardmäßig 60 Sekunden (Erklärung unten)."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/ROOT/pages/user/external-interfaces/rest-control.adoc
msgid ""
"Tip: If you only want to read current values, use the ReadOnly variant. The "
"address `+/jsonrpc+` does not work there, not even for pure queries such as "
"histories; this requires the ReadWrite variant and at least the Owner role "
"(see xref:user/data/export.adoc[Exporting data])."
msgstr ""
"Tipp: Wer nur aktuelle Werte lesen will, sollte die ReadOnly-Variante "
"verwenden. Die Adresse `+/jsonrpc+` funktioniert dort nicht, auch nicht für "
"reine Abfragen wie Verläufe; dafür ist die ReadWrite-Variante und mindestens "
"die Rolle Eigentümer nötig (siehe xref:user/data/export.adoc[Daten "
"exportieren])."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/ROOT/pages/user/external-interfaces/rest-control.adoc
#, no-wrap
msgid "Reading values"
msgstr "Werte lesen"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/ROOT/pages/user/external-interfaces/rest-control.adoc
#, no-wrap
msgid "http://x:PASSWORD@IP-OF-THE-SYSTEM:8084/rest/channel/_sum/EssSoc\n"
msgstr "http://x:PASSWORT@IP-DER-ANLAGE:8084/rest/channel/_sum/EssSoc\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/ROOT/pages/user/external-interfaces/rest-control.adoc
msgid "returns, for example, the state of charge of the storage with its unit:"
msgstr "liefert z. B. den Ladezustand des Speichers mit Einheit:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/ROOT/pages/user/external-interfaces/rest-control.adoc
#, no-wrap
msgid "{\"type\":\"INTEGER\",\"accessMode\":\"RO\",\"text\":\"\",\"unit\":\"%\",\"value\":57}\n"
msgstr "{\"type\":\"INTEGER\",\"accessMode\":\"RO\",\"text\":\"\",\"unit\":\"%\",\"value\":57}\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/ROOT/pages/user/external-interfaces/rest-control.adoc
msgid ""
"Wildcards can be used to query several values at once, e.g. the power of all "
"meters: `+/rest/channel/meter.*/ActivePower+`."
msgstr ""
"Mit Platzhaltern lassen sich mehrere Werte auf einmal abfragen, z. B. die "
"Leistung aller Zähler: `+/rest/channel/meter.*/ActivePower+`."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/ROOT/pages/user/external-interfaces/rest-control.adoc
msgid "Frequently used values:"
msgstr "Häufig genutzte Werte:"

#. type: Table
#: modules/ROOT/pages/user/external-interfaces/rest-control.adoc
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Address\n"
"| Meaning\n"
"\n"
"| `+_sum/GridActivePower+`\n"
"| Grid power (positive = purchase, negative = feed-in)\n"
"| `+_sum/ProductionActivePower+`\n"
"| Solar power\n"
"| `+_sum/ConsumptionActivePower+`\n"
"| Consumption\n"
"| `+_sum/EssSoc+`\n"
"| State of charge of the storage\n"
"| `+_sum/EssDischargePower+`\n"
"| Storage power (positive = discharging)\n"
msgstr ""
"| Adresse\n"
"| Bedeutung\n"
"\n"
"| `+_sum/GridActivePower+`\n"
"| Netzleistung (positiv = Bezug, negativ = Einspeisung)\n"
"| `+_sum/ProductionActivePower+`\n"
"| Solarleistung\n"
"| `+_sum/ConsumptionActivePower+`\n"
"| Verbrauch\n"
"| `+_sum/EssSoc+`\n"
"| Ladezustand des Speichers\n"
"| `+_sum/EssDischargePower+`\n"
"| Speicherleistung (positiv = Entladen)\n"

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/ROOT/pages/user/external-interfaces/rest-control.adoc
#, no-wrap
msgid "Controlling: two fundamentally different routes"
msgstr "Steuern: zwei grundverschiedene Wege"

#. type: Table
#: modules/ROOT/pages/user/external-interfaces/rest-control.adoc
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| \n"
"| Setting a control value\n"
"| Changing a setting\n"
"\n"
"| Example\n"
"| “Charge the storage with 2 kW now”, “Relay 1 on”\n"
"| “Switch off price control”, “Set risk propensity to High”\n"
"| Duration\n"
"| **temporary**\n"
"| **permanent**, also after a restart\n"
"| Role\n"
"| Owner (via this route)\n"
"| Owner\n"
"| Suitable for\n"
"| frequent, ongoing control\n"
"| rare changes\n"
msgstr ""
"| \n"
"| Steuerwert setzen\n"
"| Einstellung ändern\n"
"\n"
"| Beispiel\n"
"| „Speicher jetzt mit 2 kW laden“, „Relais 1 ein“\n"
"| „Preissteuerung ausschalten“, „Risikobereitschaft auf Hoch“\n"
"| Dauer\n"
"| **vorübergehend**\n"
"| **dauerhaft**, auch nach Neustart\n"
"| Rolle\n"
"| Eigentümer (über diesen Weg)\n"
"| Eigentümer\n"
"| Geeignet für\n"
"| häufige, laufende Steuerung\n"
"| seltene Änderungen\n"

#. type: Title ===
#: modules/ROOT/pages/user/external-interfaces/rest-control.adoc
#, no-wrap
msgid "Setting a control value"
msgstr "Steuerwert setzen"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/ROOT/pages/user/external-interfaces/rest-control.adoc
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"POST http://x:PASSWORD@IP-OF-THE-SYSTEM:8084/rest/channel/ess0/SetActivePowerEquals\n"
"Body: {\"value\": -2000}\n"
msgstr ""
"POST http://x:PASSWORT@IP-DER-ANLAGE:8084/rest/channel/ess0/SetActivePowerEquals\n"
"Inhalt: {\"value\": -2000}\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/ROOT/pages/user/external-interfaces/rest-control.adoc
msgid ""
"(For the storage, a negative value means charging, a positive value "
"discharging.)"
msgstr ""
"(Beim Speicher bedeutet ein negativer Wert Laden, ein positiver Entladen.)"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/ROOT/pages/user/external-interfaces/rest-control.adoc
msgid ""
"**Important – the Api-Timeout:** A control value only applies as long as it "
"is renewed regularly. If no new value arrives within the Api-Timeout "
"(default 60 seconds), OpenEMS discards it and the system returns to its "
"normal behavior."
msgstr ""
"**Wichtig – der Api-Timeout:** Ein gesetzter Steuerwert gilt nur, solange er "
"regelmäßig erneuert wird. Kommt innerhalb des Api-Timeouts (Standard 60 "
"Sekunden) kein neuer Wert, verwirft OpenEMS ihn, und die Anlage kehrt zu "
"ihrem normalen Verhalten zurück."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/ROOT/pages/user/external-interfaces/rest-control.adoc
msgid ""
"This is a **protective function**: if the home automation system fails, the "
"storage does not remain permanently on an old command."
msgstr ""
"Das ist eine **Schutzfunktion**: Fällt die Hausautomation aus, bleibt der "
"Speicher nicht dauerhaft auf einem alten Befehl stehen."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/ROOT/pages/user/external-interfaces/rest-control.adoc
msgid ""
"**If you want to control permanently, you must send the value regularly**, "
"significantly more often than the timeout, e.g. every 10 to 30 seconds."
msgstr ""
"**Wer dauerhaft steuern will, muss den Wert regelmäßig senden**, deutlich "
"häufiger als der Timeout, z. B. alle 10 bis 30 Sekunden."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/ROOT/pages/user/external-interfaces/rest-control.adoc
msgid "An empty value cancels the command immediately."
msgstr "Ein leerer Wert hebt den Befehl sofort auf."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/ROOT/pages/user/external-interfaces/rest-control.adoc
msgid ""
"Only values intended for control can be set. For pure measured values, the "
"message “is not a Write Channel” appears. Other functions and limits "
"continue to apply, e.g. the emergency reserve or the grid limits. A command "
"is therefore not always implemented in full."
msgstr ""
"Nur Werte, die zum Steuern gedacht sind, können gesetzt werden. Bei reinen "
"Messwerten kommt die Meldung „is not a Write Channel“. Andere Funktionen und "
"Grenzen gelten weiter, z. B. die Notstromreserve oder die Netzgrenzen. Ein "
"Befehl wird deshalb nicht immer vollständig umgesetzt."

#. type: Title ===
#: modules/ROOT/pages/user/external-interfaces/rest-control.adoc
#, no-wrap
msgid "Changing a setting"
msgstr "Einstellung ändern"

#. type: #sec-changing-a-setting
#: modules/ROOT/pages/user/external-interfaces/rest-control.adoc
msgid ""
"Settings are changed via the address `+/jsonrpc+` (see xref:user/external-"
"interfaces/json-rpc.adoc[JSON-RPC]):"
msgstr ""
"Einstellungen werden über die Adresse `+/jsonrpc+` geändert (siehe xref:user/"
"external-interfaces/json-rpc.adoc[JSON-RPC]):"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/ROOT/pages/user/external-interfaces/rest-control.adoc
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"POST http://x:PASSWORD@IP-OF-THE-SYSTEM:8084/jsonrpc\n"
"Body:\n"
"{\n"
"  \"method\": \"updateComponentConfig\",\n"
"  \"params\": {\n"
"    \"componentId\": \"ctrlEssTimeOfUseTariff0\",\n"
"    \"properties\": [ { \"name\": \"mode\", \"value\": \"OFF\" } ]\n"
"  }\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""
"POST http://x:PASSWORT@IP-DER-ANLAGE:8084/jsonrpc\n"
"Inhalt:\n"
"{\n"
"  \"method\": \"updateComponentConfig\",\n"
"  \"params\": {\n"
"    \"componentId\": \"ctrlEssTimeOfUseTariff0\",\n"
"    \"properties\": [ { \"name\": \"mode\", \"value\": \"OFF\" } ]\n"
"  }\n"
"}\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/ROOT/pages/user/external-interfaces/rest-control.adoc
msgid ""
"The change is saved and applies immediately. **Do not change settings every "
"minute.** Each change is written to the memory of the device, and on SD "
"cards or eMMC frequent writing leads to wear in the long term. Control "
"values are intended for ongoing control."
msgstr ""
"Die Änderung wird gespeichert und gilt sofort. **Einstellungen nicht im "
"Minutentakt ändern.** Jede Änderung wird auf den Speicher des Geräts "
"geschrieben, und bei SD-Karten oder eMMC führt häufiges Schreiben auf Dauer "
"zu Verschleiß. Für laufende Steuerung sind Steuerwerte gedacht."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/ROOT/pages/user/external-interfaces/rest-control.adoc
#, no-wrap
msgid "Common problems"
msgstr "Häufige Probleme"

#. type: #sec-common-problems
#: modules/ROOT/pages/user/external-interfaces/rest-control.adoc
msgid ""
"**Command only works for one minute:** This is the Api-Timeout. The value "
"must be sent again regularly."
msgstr ""
"**Befehl wirkt nur eine Minute:** Das ist der Api-Timeout. Der Wert muss "
"regelmäßig erneut gesendet werden."

#. type: #sec-common-problems
#: modules/ROOT/pages/user/external-interfaces/rest-control.adoc
msgid ""
"**“is not a Write Channel”:** The value is read-only. Often a setting is "
"what is actually meant."
msgstr ""
"**„is not a Write Channel“:** Der Wert ist nur lesbar. Oft ist eigentlich "
"eine Einstellung gemeint."

#. type: #sec-common-problems
#: modules/ROOT/pages/user/external-interfaces/rest-control.adoc
msgid "**Access denied:** The role of the user is not sufficient."
msgstr "**Zugriff verweigert:** Die Rolle des Benutzers reicht nicht aus."

#. type: #sec-common-problems
#: modules/ROOT/pages/user/external-interfaces/rest-control.adoc
msgid "**“Read-Only mode”:** Only the ReadOnly variant is set up."
msgstr "**„Read-Only mode“:** Es ist nur die ReadOnly-Variante eingerichtet."

#. type: #sec-common-problems
#: modules/ROOT/pages/user/external-interfaces/rest-control.adoc
msgid ""
"**Wrong address:** Settings go to `+/jsonrpc+`. The documentation in the "
"source code incorrectly mentions `+/rest/jsonrpc+`."
msgstr ""
"**Falsche Adresse:** Einstellungen gehen an `+/jsonrpc+`. Die Dokumentation "
"im Quellcode nennt fälschlich `+/rest/jsonrpc+`."
